{"version":1,"content":"<p>本港周五（10月30日）天晴，早上市區最低氣溫約25°C，新界再低兩三度。</p><p>日間乾燥，最高氣溫約30°C，吹和緩偏東風。</p><p>展望周六（10月31日）日間大致天晴及乾燥。</p><p>周日（11月1日）雲量增多，隨後一兩日部分時間有陽光。</p><p>(天文台)</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T14:02:46.316706+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T13:19:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T05:59:43.706815+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T13:59:03.823991+00:00","content_hash":"a2302ee1be59a0062d93829e82f7ddc8ec7845a8738d127223e591f48ad915f5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}